This sample request lists invoices:

curl -v -X GET https://api.sandbox.paypal.com/v1/invoicing/invoices?page=3&page_size=4&total_count_required=true \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer A21AAH-HhcwjBKG28WLgH1IDwB01dxT0V9GmGK_KBJg1wNvoATZYNF6zAiV9_VteSxo94Skcsrdp159pbMzKJmWe7OD8Rm_Mg"

